      "Visualizing relative scene depth.",
      "Prototyping browser spatial effects and depth-aware image processing."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Depth is relative rather than a calibrated metric distance.",
      "Thin structures, reflective or transparent surfaces, low light, blur, and unfamiliar visual domains may produce incorrect geometry.",
      "The single-image worker does not expose the source model's multi-view pose workflow.",
      "Depth estimates must not be used as the sole input for navigation, robotics, accessibility, or other safety-critical decisions."
